  "question": {
    "text": "A heavy box is to be dragged along a rough horizontal floor. To do so, the person <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> pushes it at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> from the horizontal and requires a minimum force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></math>, while the person <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> pulls the box at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> from the horizontal and needs minimum force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math>. If the coefficient of friction between the box and the floor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;the ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mi>30</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mi>cos</mi><mo>60</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>Divide the equation,</p><p>we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>/</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>30</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>30</mo><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>/</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>60</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>60</mo><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0144_3fb1d94336bd.png\" style=\"width: 450px; height: 149px;\" /></p>"
  }
